il granules and associates with the cell surface after stimulation with fMLP", "journal": "J. Leukoc. Biol.", "pages": "1439-49", "pubMedIdentifier": 19741154, "volume": 86, "year": 2009, "url": "http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/19741154", "className": "LiteratureReference", "schemaClass": "LiteratureReference"}], "className": "Summation", "schemaClass": "Summation"}], "reviewStatus": {"dbId": 9821382, "displayName": "five stars", "definition": "externally reviewed", "name": ["five stars"], "className": "ReviewStatus", "schemaClass": "ReviewStatus"}, "isChimeric": false, "category": "transition", "input": [{"dbId": 6800431, "displayName": "Ficolin-rich granule lumen proteins [ficolin-1-rich granule lumen]", "stId": "R-HSA-6800431", "stIdVersion": "R-HSA-6800431.2", "maxDepth": 2, "name": ["Ficolin-rich granule lumen proteins"], "speciesName": "Homo sapiens", "consumedByEvent": [6800434], "species": [48887], "className": "Set", "inDisease": false, "schemaClass": "DefinedSet"}], "output": [{"dbId": 6806481, "displayName": "Ficolin-rich granule lumen proteins [extracellular region]", "stId": "R-HSA-6806481", "stIdVersion": "R-HSA-6806481.2", "maxDepth": 2, "name": ["Ficolin-rich granule lumen proteins"], "speciesName": "Homo sapiens", "producedByEvent": [6800434], "species": [48887], "className": "Set", "inDisease": false, "schemaClass": "DefinedSet"}], "className": "Reaction", "schemaClass": "Reaction"}